{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChTPkagxeiejrynwLuCFZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011V3LKorHz7cVNHZRVG7nTo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"find apps/cinescope -type f -not -path '*/node_modules/*' | sort && echo ---- && cat apps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts apps/cinescope/src/app/app.config.ts apps/cinescope/src/app/models.ts apps/cinescope/src/app/cinema-api.ts apps/cinescope/src/app/dates.ts && echo ---- && cat spec/tickets/01-movie-list.md | head -30 && git status --short && ls apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list apps/cinescope/src/app/placeholder","description":"List app files and read existing app code"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13996,"cache_read_input_tokens":27147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13996,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01N31yniJEnfJFXEBbrc1PF1","session_id":"1e089a7a-4bad-4c15-8bdb-116c29d15f7d","uuid":"d5a152b3-2e42-489d-81fd-f7f9867a29ab","timestamp":"2026-11-27T11:58:10.241Z","request_id":"req_011ChTPkaX3WNE4ofafXcSb1","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 02"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011V3LKorHz7cVNHZRVG7nTo","type":"tool_result","content":"apps/cinescope/eslint.config.mjs\napps/cinescope/project.json\napps/cinescope/public/favicon.ico\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.config.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.spec.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/cinema-api.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/dates.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/models.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/placeholder/placeholder.ts\napps/cinescope/src/index.html\napps/cinescope/src/main.ts\napps/cinescope/src/styles.scss\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.app.json\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.json\napps/cinescope/tsconfig.spec.json\n----\nimport { Routes } from '@angular/router';\nimport { MovieList } from './movie-list/movie-list';\nimport { Placeholder } from './placeholder/placeholder';\n\nexport const appRoutes: Routes = [\n  { path: '', component: MovieList },\n  { path: 'screenings/:id/seats', component: Placeholder },\n  { path: 'screenings/:id/summary', component: Placeholder },\n  { path: 'screenings/:id/checkout', component: Placeholder },\n  { path: 'confirmation', component: Placeholder },\n  { path: '**', redirectTo: '' },\n];\nimport { ApplicationConfig, provideBrowserGlobalErrorListeners } from '@angular/core';\nimport { provideHttpClient } from '@angular/common/http';\nimport { provideNativeDateAdapter } from '@angular/material/core';\nimport { provideRouter } from '@angular/router';\nimport { appRoutes } from './app.routes';\n\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    provideBrowserGlobalErrorListeners(),\n    provideHttpClient(),\n    provideRouter(appRoutes),\n    provideNativeDateAdapter(),\n  ],\n};\nexport interface Movie {\n  id: number;\n  title: string;\n  genre: string;\n  runtimeMinutes: number;\n  format: 'PL dubbing' | 'PL subtitles';\n}\n\nexport interface Screening {\n  id: number;\n  movieId: number;\n  date: string;\n  time: string;\n  occupiedSeats: string[];\n}\nimport { HttpClient } from '@angular/common/http';\nimport { inject, Injectable } from '@angular/core';\nimport { Observable } from 'rxjs';\nimport { Movie, Screening } from './models';\n\nconst API_BASE_URL = 'http://localhost:3000';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: 'root' })\nexport class CinemaApi {\n  private readonly http = inject(HttpClient);\n\n  getMovies(): Observable<Movie[]> {\n    return this.http.get<Movie[]>(`${API_BASE_URL}/movies`);\n  }\n\n  getScreenings(date: string): Observable<Screening[]> {\n    return this.http.get<Screening[]>(`${API_BASE_URL}/screenings`, { params: { date } });\n  }\n}\nconst WEEKDAY_NAMES = ['Sunday', 'Monday', 'Tuesday', 'Wednesday', 'Thursday', 'Friday', 'Saturday'];\n\n/** Local-calendar date at midnight for the current browser day. */\nexport function startOfToday(): Date {\n  const now = new Date();\n  return new Date(now.getFullYear(), now.getMonth(), now.getDate());\n}\n\nexport function addDays(date: Date, days: number): Date {\n  return new Date(date.getFullYear(), date.getMonth(), date.getDate() + days);\n}\n\n/** Formats a date as `YYYY-MM-DD` using its local calendar fields. */\nexport function toIsoDate(date: Date): string {\n  const year = String(date.getFullYear()).padStart(4, '0');\n  const month = String(date.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');\n  const day = String(date.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');\n  return `${year}-${month}-${day}`;\n}\n\n/** Parses a `YYYY-MM-DD` string into a local date at midnight. */\nexport function isoToDate(iso: string): Date {\n  const [year, month, day] = iso.split('-').map(Number);\n  return new Date(year, month - 1, day);\n}\n\n/** True for a well-formed ISO date that exists in the calendar (e.g. not 2026-02-30). */\nexport function isValidIsoDate(value: string | null): value is string {\n  if (value === null || !/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(value)) {\n    return false;\n  }\n  return toIsoDate(isoToDate(value)) === value;\n}\n\nexport function weekdayName(date: Date): string {\n  return WEEKDAY_NAMES[date.getDay()];\n}\n----\n# 01: Movie list and day picker\n\n**What to build:** A customer opens `/`, picks a day with the day picker (five day buttons and a datepicker), and sees the movies playing that day with their screening times, loaded from the backend, with loading, error and empty states. The selected day lives in the URL. Clicking a screening opens its seat map route. Also sets up the five routes from section 3 (screens 2–5 may be empty placeholders for now) and the redirect of unknown URLs to `/`.\n\n**Specification:** sections 1, 2, 3 (routes), 3.3, 4, 9.1.\n\n**Blocked by:** None (can start immediately).\n\n**Status:** done\n\n- [x] AC-01 — Without a chosen date, `/` shows today's screenings: one movie card per movie with a screening today.\n- [x] AC-02 — Each card shows title, genre, runtime in minutes and format (`PL dubbing` / `PL subtitles`).\n- [x] AC-03 — Each card renders one button per screening of that movie on the selected day, labelled with the screening time (`HH:mm`), ordered by time.\n- [x] AC-04 — Clicking a screening button navigates to `/screenings/:id/seats` for that screening id.\n- [x] AC-49 — While the movie request is in flight, `/` shows a loading indicator and no movie cards.\n- [x] AC-50 — When the movie request fails, `/` shows `Failed to load movies` and a `Retry` button that re-issues the request.\n- [x] AC-52 — Above the movie list, the day picker shows `Today` and the next four days by English weekday name, followed by a datepicker; `Today` is selected by default.\n- [x] AC-53 — Choosing another day shows only the movies with a screening on that day, each with only that day's screenings.\n- [x] AC-54 — A day without screenings shows `No screenings on this day` and no movie cards.\n- [x] AC-55 — The selected day is kept in the URL as `?date=YYYY-MM-DD`; opening such a URL selects that day, and a missing, invalid or past date selects today.\n- [x] AC-51 — Every movie-list identifier in section 9.1 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n M apps/cinescope/src/app/app.config.ts\n M apps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts\n M spec/tickets/01-movie-list.md\n?? .pnpm-store/\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/cinema-api.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/dates.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/models.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/placeholder/\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list:\nmovie-list.html\nmovie-list.scss\nmovie-list.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/placeholder:\nplaceholder.ts","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01N31yniJEnfJFXEBbrc1PF1","session_id":"1e089a7a-4bad-4c15-8bdb-116c29d15f7d","uuid":"e08c1722-8afa-4cca-9ec8-40ff3f063337","timestamp":"2026-11-27T11:58:10.282Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 02"}
