{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChTPv3fgWMZMApuysbEdB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01S8Fag8GJvZKyLZULNVTjUo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md; echo ----; head -20 spec/tickets/05-checkout.md; echo ----; cat apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.scss | head -60; cat apps/cinescope/package.json 2>/dev/null; ls node_modules/@angular/material | grep -i snack","description":"Read tickets 04 and 05 and check Material snack-bar package"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6199,"cache_read_input_tokens":46039,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6199,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01H1BKzNkebJieUcj9asD2TB","session_id":"1e089a7a-4bad-4c15-8bdb-116c29d15f7d","uuid":"dfa0a521-edf1-45f5-8aac-7acb4d92818e","timestamp":"2026-11-27T12:00:43.669Z","request_id":"req_011ChTPv3SoSgt668JoG4Mry","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 03"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S8Fag8GJvZKyLZULNVTjUo","type":"tool_result","content":"# 04: Booking and summary\n\n**What to build:** The selection becomes a booking kept in `sessionStorage`. `Continue` takes the customer to the summary (`Your tickets`), which lists each ticket with its price, a `Remove` button and the total; `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact and `Cancel` on the seat map clears the booking. The summary and checkout routes redirect to `/` without a matching booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 5.4, 5.6, 6, 9.3, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 03 — Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-30 — Seats in rows 11–14 cost `39.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-31 — A couch costs `89.00 PLN` per couch, not per seat.\n- [ ] AC-32 — Accessible seats cost `25.00 PLN`, like the rest of row 1.\n- [ ] AC-33 — `Cancel` navigates to `/` and clears the selection.\n- [ ] AC-34 — `Continue` navigates to `/screenings/:id/summary`.\n- [ ] AC-35 — `Continue` does nothing when no seat is selected.\n- [ ] AC-36 — Each selected item is listed with movie title, screening date, time, row number, seat description and price.\n- [ ] AC-37 — A couch is described as `Couch <a>-<b>`; a single seat is described by its column number.\n- [ ] AC-38 — The total line reads `Total: <sum> PLN` and equals the sum of the listed prices.\n- [ ] AC-39 — `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact.\n- [ ] AC-40 — `Confirm` navigates to `/screenings/:id/checkout`.\n- [ ] AC-59 — The summary shows the title `Your tickets`.\n- [ ] AC-60 — Each summary item has a `Remove` button that removes it from the booking and updates the total; removing the last item returns to the seat map.\n- [ ] AC-67 — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n- [ ] The booking survives a reload of the seat map and of the summary.\n----\n# 05: Checkout and payment\n\n**What to build:** The customer fills in their details on the checkout form (`Your details`), sees validation messages as they go, can go `Back` to the summary and return — or reload — without losing what they typed, and pays with the `Pay <total> PLN` button. Paying sends the reservation to the backend; success opens `/confirmation`, failure keeps the form and shows a toast.\n\n**Specification:** sections 2.1, 2.2 (`POST /reservations`), 3.1, 7, 9.4, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 04 — Booking and summary.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-41 — The form renders first name, last name, email, confirm email, phone number and a terms checkbox.\n- [ ] AC-42 — First name and last name are required and must be at least 2 characters.\n- [ ] AC-43 — Email is required and must be a valid address; confirm email must match it.\n- [ ] AC-44 — Phone number is optional; when filled it must be exactly 9 digits.\n- [ ] AC-45 — The terms checkbox is required.\n- [ ] AC-46 — The pay button is enabled whenever no payment request is in flight; clicking it on an invalid form marks all fields as touched, shows the messages and shows the toast `The form contains errors`, without navigating.\n- [ ] AC-47 — The pay button on a valid form sends `POST /reservations`, is disabled while the request is in flight, navigates to `/confirmation` on success, and on failure stays on the form and shows the toast `Payment failed. Please try again.`\n- [ ] AC-61 — The checkout shows the title `Your details`.\n- [ ] AC-62 — The pay button reads `Pay <total> PLN`, the total of the booking.\n- [ ] AC-63 — `Back` on the checkout returns to the summary with the booking intact.\n----\n:host {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.page {\n  max-width: 960px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 24px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n.day-picker {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n\n  mat-form-field {\n    width: 240px;\n  }\n}\n\n.status {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.movie-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.movie-card {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n\n  h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n}\n\n.screenings {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 8px;\nsnack-bar","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01H1BKzNkebJieUcj9asD2TB","session_id":"1e089a7a-4bad-4c15-8bdb-116c29d15f7d","uuid":"041c2742-1461-44de-8685-31db8cab8e73","timestamp":"2026-11-27T12:00:43.709Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 03"}
