t:** a shared `Toaster` in `apps/cinescope/src/app/toast/toast.ts` built on Material's snack bar, with `data-testid=\"toast\"` on the message and a 4-second duration.\n- **Cancel / Continue:** present with their identifiers, so AC-66 holds. I wired them minimally (Cancel clears and goes to `/`; Continue is disabled with no seats and otherwise opens the summary route). Ticket 04 owns their full behaviour.\n\nAll 14 boxes in `spec/tickets/03-seat-selection.md` are ticked and its Status is `done`."}],"resolvedModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","totalDurationMs":112377,"totalTokens":86024,"totalToolUseCount":23,"usage":{"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":44},"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":925,"cache_read_input_tokens":84604,"output_tokens":493,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":925},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":6,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":10,"editFileCount":7,"linesAdded":523,"linesRemoved":4,"otherToolCount":0}}}
