. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LeWDud3coAU24LZUtHfAki","session_id":"1e089a7a-4bad-4c15-8bdb-116c29d15f7d","uuid":"92d483fd-ea6c-48c4-a9b2-b5c2c099e842","timestamp":"2026-11-27T12:07:35.286Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 07"}
